doctype html

html
    head
        title BTC AG Open Source
        include partials/head.pug

    body
        include partials/header.pug
        main
            .btc-welcome
                img#btc-logo(src='img/btc-logo.png')
                span.divider
                h1 Open Source Projects
                p Innovative tools and frameworks developed by BTC AG - empowering developers worldwide with cutting-edge technology solutions.
                img#btc-sticker(src='img/BTC_loves_developers.png')
            .project-showcase
                .project
                    img.project-logo(src='img/saa-logo.svg')
                    h2.project-title Sovereign Architecture Advisor (SAA)
                    .project-description
                        p
                            | Ein interaktiver Wizard zur Bewertung und Empfehlung souveräner Cloud-Architekturen für Unternehmensanwendungen - Fokus auf europäische Datensouveränität.
                        p
                            | Hilft Organisationen bei der Evaluierung und dem Vergleich von Cloud-Anbietern, insbesondere europäischer und souveräner Alternativen, basierend auf Multi-Kriterien-Analysen.
                        p
                            | Wählen Sie Anwendungen aus, konfigurieren Sie Komponenten, legen Sie Sizing-Parameter fest und erhalten Sie gewichtete Empfehlungen mit detaillierten Kostenschätzungen.
                    .tech-stack
                        span.tech-badge Cloud Architecture
                        span.tech-badge Decision Support
                        span.tech-badge Cost Analysis
                        span.tech-badge Sovereignty
                    .github-stats
                        .stat
                            span 🇪🇺
                            span European Cloud Sovereignty
                    .project-link
                        a(href='https://github.com/btc-ag/SAA')
                            span Learn more
                            i.arrow
                .project
                    img.project-logo(src='img/scc-logo.svg')
                    h2.project-title Sovereign Cloud Compass (SCC)
                    .project-description
                        p
                            | Ein interaktives Tool zur Bewertung und Auswahl von Cloud-Anbietern basierend auf der Balance zwischen Kontrolle/Souveränität und Performance-Fähigkeiten.
                        p
                            | Bewerten Sie Cloud-Anbieter über zwei Dimensionen - Souveränität und Performance - mit dynamischer Gewichtung. 2D-Matrix-Visualisierung macht komplexe Entscheidungen transparent und nachvollziehbar.
                        p
                            | Filterung nach Anbieter-Kategorie und transparente Scoring-Methodik für über 14 Cloud-Provider. Ideal für strategische IT-Entscheidungen.
                    .tech-stack
                        span.tech-badge Cloud Providers
                        span.tech-badge Decision Matrix
                        span.tech-badge Visualization
                        span.tech-badge Analytics
                    .github-stats
                        .stat
                            span 📊
                            span 14+ Cloud Providers
                    .project-link
                        a(href='https://github.com/btc-ag/SCC')
                            span Learn more
                            i.arrow
                .project
                    img.project-logo(src='img/BTC_loves_developers.png')
                    h2.project-title Service IDL
                    .project-description
                        p
                            | Xtext-based Service IDL (Interface Definition Language) and Code Generators for Protobuf, C++, Java and .NET.
                        p
                            | Define your service interfaces once and generate code for multiple platforms. Streamlines cross-platform development with consistent API definitions.
                        p
                            strong Note:
                            |  Currently experimental, and not yet suitable for general use.
                    .tech-stack
                        span.tech-badge Xtext
                        span.tech-badge Protobuf
                        span.tech-badge C++
                        span.tech-badge Java
                        span.tech-badge .NET
                    .github-stats
                        .stat
                            span 🔬
                            span Experimental Project
                    .project-link
                        a(href='https://github.com/btc-ag/service-idl')
                            span Learn more
                            i.arrow
                .project
                    img.project-logo(src='img/BTC_loves_developers.png')
                    h2.project-title featuretoggle
                    .project-description
                        p
                            | A simple, lightweight feature toggle framework for ABAP - enabling continuous delivery in SAP environments.
                        p
                            | Toggle features in ABAP code at runtime, delivering potentially unfinished features in a deactivated state to production. Perfect for implementing CI/CD practices in SAP landscapes.
                        p
                            | Includes ABAP backend and UI5 GUI to manage toggle states with an intuitive interface.
                    .tech-stack
                        span.tech-badge ABAP
                        span.tech-badge SAP UI5
                        span.tech-badge CI/CD
                        span.tech-badge SAP
                    .github-stats
                        .stat
                            span 🔄
                            span Continuous Delivery
                    .project-link
                        a(href='https://github.com/btc-ag/featuretoggle')
                            span Learn more
                            i.arrow
                .project
                    img.project-logo(src='img/redg-logo.svg')
                    h2.project-title RedG
                    .project-description
                        p
                            strong Note:
                            |  RedG has been moved to #[a(href='https://github.com/yamass') yamass] and is not maintained by BTC anymore.
                        p
                            | Model your database test data with a plain Java DSL! RedG makes modelling database test data for unit tests incredibly simple. It reduces modelling to the theoretically reachable minimum.
                        p
                            | RedG offers first-class Maven support, debugging tools and great customizability. Perfect for enterprise applications with complex database schemas.
                    .tech-stack
                        span.tech-badge Java
                        span.tech-badge Maven
                        span.tech-badge Testing
                        span.tech-badge DSL
                    .github-stats
                        .stat
                            span ⚠️
                            span Moved to yamass
                    .project-link
                        a(href='https://github.com/yamass/redg')
                            span View on GitHub
                            i.arrow

        include partials/footer.pug
